1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:08,311
Maya wants a lemonade stand for visitors.

3
00:00:08,311 --> 00:00:09,906
Oh no!

4
00:00:09,906 --> 00:00:12,300
A visitor is scared.

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,760
Is this a fake stand?

6
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:17,819
A crowd shouts all at once.

7
00:00:17,819 --> 00:00:21,595
Building the stand by hand takes forever.

8
00:00:21,595 --> 00:00:24,414
Seal is the lock on the door.

9
00:00:24,414 --> 00:00:26,303
She glows.

10
00:00:26,303 --> 00:00:29,215
This is really Maya's house.

11
00:00:29,215 --> 00:00:31,821
The visitor relaxes.

12
00:00:31,821 --> 00:00:34,494
Winn is the ticket window.

13
00:00:34,494 --> 00:00:37,446
She hands tickets in order.

14
00:00:37,446 --> 00:00:39,069
Too many?

15
00:00:39,069 --> 00:00:41,502
She holds up a hand.

16
00:00:41,502 --> 00:00:42,898
Wait.

17
00:00:42,898 --> 00:00:45,372
Poppy is the booth kit.

18
00:00:45,372 --> 00:00:47,140
One pop!

19
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:49,787
The whole stand is ready.

20
00:00:49,787 --> 00:00:52,965
Happy visitors in a tidy line.

21
00:00:52,965 --> 00:00:54,946
Maya waves.

22
00:00:54,946 --> 00:00:58,404
Now you know the name tag on the door!

23
00:00:58,404 --> 00:01:03,098
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

